* NMOS OFF - subcircuit version of nmos_off_ngspice.cir, for use inside gate netlists (Part B / Part C)
* Same device as the dataset netlist:  M1 d g s b nmos L=22n W=...   (terminals d g s b, width as a parameter)
* The OFF state comes from the gate voltage applied by the gate netlist; the device itself is the same as in nmos_off_ngspice.cir.
.include 22nm_HP.pm
.subckt nmos_off d g s b w=44n
M1 d g s b nmos L=22n W={w}
.ends nmos_off
